=== HINT 1 ===
max2: use an if/else or the ternary operator:  a > b ? a : b

=== HINT 2 ===
is_even: a number is even when n % 2 == 0

=== HINT 3 ===
celsius_to_f: the formula is  F = C * 9.0 / 5.0 + 32.0
Use 9.0/5.0 (not 9/5) to avoid integer division.

=== HINT 4 (SPOILER) ===
int max2(int a, int b)           { return a > b ? a : b; }
int is_even(int n)               { return n % 2 == 0; }
double celsius_to_f(double c)    { return c * 9.0 / 5.0 + 32.0; }
